      "content": "it just feels so much more dignified to just... stop. if i'm not here, they can at least remember me as the kid who was going to make it, instead of the person who let them down. sometimes a clean break feels better than dragging out this shame forever. wouldn't it be easier for them to just move on if i wasn't constantly reminding them of my mistake?",
